Unpuzzle levels block by block! Tap away the puzzle blocks. Start swiping bricks! Train the brain! Like satisfying puzzle games & brain teasers? Play this tapping game! Clear the screen! Remove all the box arrows! Help them escape - fly away! 
Relieve your stress, relax your mind! Clear the level!

More than 1000 tapping levels! A large number of app mechanics will make you think about brain solving various problems.
Slide your finger carefully. Start training to boost logic and critical thinking in this color game of numbers and arrows to remove.

- Challenging and addictive unlock puzzle game;
- Smooth finger tapping experience;
- Relax your mind, relieve your stress;
- Brain teaser with satisfying taps away. Boost your logic and critical thinking;
- Customize your color bricks with different skins and themes;
- Use your finger. Remove the box arrows. Help the number bricks escape. Tap the blocks to release them and clear the level;
- Unlock all the challenging levels. No time limits to release the box.

Tap the blocks to unpuzzle them and fly away. But the puzzle blocks will only fly away in one direction, so you’ve got to approach this swiping game and brain teaser carefully! Help the color bricks escape! Tricky, challenging yet stress relieving and satisfying taps!
